<title>USA: Holzman named U.S. ambassador to Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>Holzman named U.S. ambassador to Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton has chosen career diplomat John Holzman to be U.S. ambassador to Bangladesh, the White House said Thursday.</p>
<p>It said Clinton would nominate Holzman, deputy chief of the U.S. mission is Islamabad since 1994, to the Dhaka post.</p>
<p>The nomination requires Senate confirmation.</p>
